# Gradix

Construction-ops platform: web panel, Expo, public company one-page, multi-company, ERP-lite, payroll export, IoT fleet. Source of truth: `.cursor/docs/DECISIONS.md` + `.cursor/docs/DOMAIN.md` + matrices + `.cursor/plans/gradix-core/PLAN_FREEZE.md` (ako nije u freeze-u, nije v1).

## Layout

- `backend/` NestJS + TypeScript strict + Prisma 7 + MySQL 8
- `frontend/` React (Vite) + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn
- `mobile/` Expo + TypeScript + i18n + light/dark/system
- Plan: `.cursor/plans/gradix-core/` (phases 1–11). **Svih 11 faza plan locked.**
- Matrices: `.cursor/docs/matrices/<feature>/MATRIX.md` + `CHANGELOG.md`

## Banned

- Turborepo `apps/*`, Next.js, Express/Fastify, PostgreSQL
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` (use `VITE_*`)
- Custom WS port; Socket.IO shares the Nest HTTP server
- WatermelonDB / BullMQ / Redis until a phase segment requires them
- Ad-hoc SQL outside Prisma migrations
- Email / FCM delivery until the matching Settings flag is on (stubs only). **SMS is out of the product.**
- Trusting JWT for roles (JWT is `sub` only; roles from DB)
- Unscoped list queries (always company + data-scope)

## Product rules

- Tenant: `Company` + `companyId`. `X-Company-Id` only for PLATFORM_ADMIN (else 400).
- Timer: one open session per user (`TIMER_ALREADY_OPEN`). machineId null until phase 4. Pause does not accrue; close-while-paused adds to pauseAccum. Auto-close after `timer.maxOpenHours` (12). Complete = `tasks.write` only. Hours accrue on machine from phase 4.
- Onboarding: API-created users get a one-time temp password + `mustChangePassword`. ADMIN may reset-password (new temp once). Seed users do not force-change. Inactive company → login 401.
- Quantities: manual BOQ; do not mix into progress %. Trips do not auto-add executed qty.
- Geofence info-only; not payroll evidence. No SMS.
- Trips/fuel immutable after sync; Amendment for corrections.
- Public DTO whitelist. File paths must start with `{companyId}/`. Socket rooms server-side.
- Roles N:M, permission union. SUPER_ADMIN is per-company.
- PM/SS see assigned projects only. ADMIN/ACCOUNTANT see the whole company.
- GPS: `UserLocation` vs machine `GpsRecord`. Phone first; IoT in phase 11.
- Spend/progress: `.cursor/docs/matrices/spend-progress/MATRIX.md` — never invent KPIs.
- Public site: `/p/:slug` (phase 8). Panel: `/login`.
- i18n BS default + EN. Apple-linear. Mobile web = Sheet.
- Money: Decimal. Dates UTC. Display = company `app.timezone` (default Europe/Sarajevo).
- API envelope `{ success, data, meta }` / `{ success: false, error: { code, message } }`.
- Lists: `page`, `limit`, `sort`, `order`.
- Uploads: MinIO, path in DB, `{companyId}/` prefix.
- Offline (phase 6): expo-sqlite. Trip, TimerSession, FuelEntry, DiaryEntry, photo.
- File length 100–150; split at 200 (schema/config up to 400).
- Logic change ⇒ MATRIX + CHANGELOG; delete dead code.
- No application code until the user starts a named phase. Planning freeze must be written first ([PLAN_FREEZE.md](../plans/gradix-core/PLAN_FREEZE.md)).

